# Published because a tracked file points at them, which is the only test that
# matters here: HANDOFF.md names the roadmap as the thing to read before choosing
# work, experiments/README.md links the guard-index write-up, and release.yml reads
# the release notes to publish them. tests/test_published_docs.py enforces it.
!docs/guard-index.md
!docs/plan.md
!docs/roadmap.md
!docs/release-notes/
.wiredo-audit.json
.codesextant-baseline.json
